+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=SeanWong17%2FFuture-Style-Periodic-Table)
+
+Wasmer runs `npm install` and `npm run build`, then serves the generated `dist/` directory as static files. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To deploy your own changes, fork this repository and import your fork on Wasmer.
+
 ### Browser Compatibility
 - ✅ Chrome 90+
 - ✅ Firefox 88+
